<title>USA: Sierra Health Services Inc Q1 shr eases.</title>
<headline>Sierra Health Services Inc Q1 shr eases.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>March 31,1997		March 31,1996</p>
<p> Oper shr	  $    0.55		$    $0.58</p>
<p> Net		    9,800		    10,200</p>
<p> Revs		 171,000		   136,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: A charge of $8.4 million, net of tax effects, was posted in the 1997 quarter to cover estimated expenses relating to the potential merger with Physician Corporation of America. On March 18, 1997, Sierra sent a letter to PCA stating that the merger agreement was terminated.  Including the charge, net income for the quarter was $1.4 million or $.08 per share.</p>
</text>
